  "interpretation": "<h3 data-start=\"883\" data-end=\"924\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.38px;\"><strong data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"924\">Clinical Use / Interpretation:</strong></span></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"1191\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 8.38px;\" data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"990\">\n<p data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"990\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.38px;\">Detects <strong data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"953\">IgM antibodies</strong> specific to <em data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"990\">Legionella pneumophila</em></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 8.38px;\" data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1046\">\n<p data-start=\"993\" data-end=\"1046\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.38px;\">Helps in early diagnosis of <strong data-start=\"1021\" data-end=\"1046\">Legionnaires&rsquo; disease</strong></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 8.38px;\" data-start=\"1047\" data-end=\"1111\">\n<p data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1111\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.38px;\">A <strong data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1067\">positive IgM</strong> result suggests recent or acute infection</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 8.38px;\" data-start=\"1112\" data-end=\"1191\">\n<p data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1191\"><span style=\"font-size: 8.38px;\">May be used in combination with <strong data-start=\"1146\" data-end=\"1168\">Urine Antigen Test</strong> for better sensitivity</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
